## Typography (semantic utilities in globals.css)

| Role | Utility |
|------|---------|
| Page title | `text-page-title` |
| Page subtitle | `text-page-subtitle` |
| Section header | `text-section-header` |
| Section header large | `text-section-header-large` |
| Card title | `text-card-title` |
| Card description | `text-card-description` |
| Section title | `text-section-title` |
| Section item label | `text-section-item-label` |
| Form label | `text-form-label` |
| Sub label | `text-sub-label` |
| Small | `text-small`, `text-small-medium`, `text-small-semibold`, `text-small-leading` |
| Caption | `text-caption-leading` |
| KPI value | `text-kpi` |
| Score | `text-score` |
| Hero | `text-hero`, `text-hero-large` |
| Badge | `text-badge` |
| CTA title | `text-cta-title` |

**Font:** Inter via `@fontsource-variable/inter` (self-hosted). Use `font-sans` or `var(--font-sans)`.

---

## Spacing (semantic utilities)

| Utility | Usage |
|---------|-------|
| `page-padding` | Page-level container |
| `section-gap` | Gap between major sections |
| `column-gap` | Two-column layouts |
| `card-header-padding` | Card header |
| `card-content-padding` | Card body |
| `table-cell-padding` | Table cells |
| `tip-banner-padding` | Tip banners |
| `footer-padding` | Footer action row |

Standard Tailwind scale: `gap-1`–`gap-12`, `p-1`–`p-12`.

---

