| `max-w-section-header`, `max-w-section-desc` | Section headers |
| `max-w-faq`, `max-w-cta`, `max-w-cta-desc`, `max-w-footer-brand` | Various |

---

## Radius

Use `rounded-md`, `rounded-lg`, `rounded-xl` — or `card-base` for cards.

---

## No Shadows

Cards and surfaces: `rounded-xl border border-border bg-card`. No shadows.

---

## Tailwind v4

- `@import "tailwindcss"` in globals.css (no `@tailwind` directives)
- Use `@theme inline` for mapping CSS vars to Tailwind
- Fonts: utility classes in `@layer base`
